"Antigravity account metadata paths must not contain symbolic links." = "Antigravity 账号信息路径不能包含符号链接。";
"Antigravity could not restore the previous login. Keep Antigravity and agy closed, unlock Keychain, and select the previous saved account again in Moa." = "无法恢复 Antigravity 之前的登录。请保持 Antigravity 和 agy 关闭，解锁钥匙串后，在 Moa 中重新选择之前保存的账号。";
"Antigravity did not quit. Finish active tasks and quit it, then try again." = "Antigravity 未退出。请结束进行中的任务并退出应用，然后重试。";
"Antigravity login changed during the operation. Close all shared clients and try again." = "操作期间 Antigravity 的登录发生了变化。请关闭所有共享登录的客户端后重试。";
"Antigravity login format is unsupported or incomplete. Sign in with a personal Google account and save it again." = "Antigravity 登录格式不受支持或不完整。请使用个人 Google 账号登录后重新保存。";
"Antigravity or a shared login process is still running. Close it before changing accounts." = "Antigravity 或共享登录的进程仍在运行。请关闭后再切换账号。";
"Antigravity quits and reopens. Finish active tasks and close agy and Antigravity IDE extensions first; they share the active login." = "Antigravity 会退出并重新打开。请先结束进行中的任务，并关闭共享当前登录的 agy 和 Antigravity IDE 扩展。";
"Antigravity will quit normally, save its latest Google login in Keychain, and reopen. Finish active tasks and close agy and Antigravity IDE extensions first." = "Antigravity 会正常退出，将最新的 Google 登录保存到钥匙串后重新打开。请先结束进行中的任务，并关闭 agy 和 Antigravity IDE 扩展。";
"Close agy, Antigravity IDE, and Antigravity IDE extensions before saving or switching accounts. They share the active login." = "保存或切换账号前，请先关闭 agy、Antigravity IDE 及 Antigravity IDE 扩展，它们会共享当前登录。";
"Enter an account name of 1 to 200 characters." = "请输入 1 至 200 个字符的账号名称。";
"Install Antigravity App 2.x before managing its accounts. Antigravity IDE uses a different login store." = "请先安装 Antigravity App 2.x 再管理账号。Antigravity IDE 使用不同的登录存储。";
"Moa - Codex, Claude, ZCode, WorkBuddy, WorkBuddy AI, DeepSeek, Antigravity" = "Moa - Codex、Claude、ZCode、WorkBuddy、WorkBuddy AI、DeepSeek、Antigravity";
"Moa saves the current login in Keychain, quits Antigravity, and opens a fresh Google sign-in. Sign in with the other account, then save it in Moa. Finish active tasks and close agy and Antigravity IDE extensions first." = "Moa 会将当前登录保存到钥匙串，退出 Antigravity 后打开新的 Google 登录界面。请登录另一个账号，然后在 Moa 中保存。操作前请先结束进行中的任务，并关闭 agy 和 Antigravity IDE 扩展。";
"Save Antigravity Account" = "保存 Antigravity 账号";
"Sign in to Antigravity with your Google account before saving the current login." = "请先在 Antigravity 中登录 Google 账号，再保存当前登录。";
"The saved Antigravity login could not be restored after a failed delete. Save that account again after unlocking Keychain." = "删除失败后无法恢复保存的 Antigravity 登录。请解锁钥匙串后重新保存该账号。";
"The saved Antigravity login is missing or does not match its account. Sign in and save it again." = "保存的 Antigravity 登录缺失或与账号不匹配。请登录后重新保存。";
"Unable to check Antigravity processes. Close Antigravity, agy, and its IDE extensions, then try again." = "无法检查 Antigravity 进程。请关闭 Antigravity、agy 及相关 IDE 扩展后重试。";
"Unable to lock the Antigravity account store. Check its local directory permissions." = "无法锁定 Antigravity 账号存储，请检查本机目录权限。";
"Unable to open Antigravity. Open it manually and check the selected account." = "无法打开 Antigravity。请手动打开并检查所选账号。";
"Updating Antigravity…" = "正在更新 Antigravity…";
"Use Save Current Login to allow Moa to read the Antigravity login in Keychain." = "请使用“保存当前登录”，授权 Moa 读取钥匙串中的 Antigravity 登录。";
"Run Keychain access repair from the installed Moa.app." = "请从已安装的 Moa.app 运行钥匙串授权修复。";
"Sign Moa with the existing code signing certificate before repairing Keychain access." = "请先用已有的代码签名证书为 Moa 签名，再修复钥匙串授权。";
"Open Antigravity" = "打开 Antigravity";
"Antigravity's app or backend signature could not be verified as Google software. Reinstall the official Antigravity App before managing logins." = "无法确认 Antigravity 应用或后端的签名来自 Google。请重新安装官方 Antigravity App 后再管理登录。";
"Reopen Antigravity" = "重新打开 Antigravity";
